{
  "uid": "incident-resolution",
  "title": "Resolução de Incidentes — Observabilidade",
  "tags": ["observability", "demo", "lgtm"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 3,
  "refresh": "",
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": { "from": "now-15m", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "scenario",
        "label": "Filtrar Cenário",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "fast,io,db,cpu",
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": ["All"],
          "value": ["$__all"]
        },
        "options": [
          { "selected": true, "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
          { "selected": false, "text": "fast", "value": "fast" },
          { "selected": false, "text": "io", "value": "io" },
          { "selected": false, "text": "db", "value": "db" },
          { "selected": false, "text": "cpu", "value": "cpu" }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Guia Interativo da Demonstração (Auto-Refresh desligado — use o botão Refresh ou escolha 30s no topo)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Fluxo: **1. Sintoma (Métricas)** ➔ **2. Isolamento (Service Graph & Traces)** ➔ **3. Contexto (Logs no Loki)** ➔ **4. Código (Pyroscope)**\n💡 **Filtro:** o seletor **Filtrar Cenário** no topo vale para **todos** os painéis (métricas, traces, logs e profiling). Nos gráficos `2A` e `2B`, clique numa barra e escolha **Filtrar Dashboard** no menu que aparece.\n| Cenário | Comportamento | O que observar | Comando para disparar ao vivo |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| 🟢 **fast** (40%) | Rápido (50–200ms), HTTP 200 | P95 baixo (~0.18s), sem erros | `curl -X POST \"http://localhost:8080/checkout?scenario=fast\"` |\n| 🟡 **io** (20%) | Gateway lento (1.5s–3.0s), HTTP 200 | Maior vilão do P95, **mas o Flamegraph fica quase vazio** (espera não gasta CPU) | `curl -X POST \"http://localhost:8080/checkout?scenario=io\"` |\n| 🔴 **db** (20%) | Erro HTTP 500 (Pool esgotado) | 5xx em 100% no filtro, 502 em cascata no checkout, Log `Database connection timeout` | `curl -X POST \"http://localhost:8080/checkout?scenario=db\"` |\n| 🟣 **cpu** (20%) | Loop antifraude (0.5s–1.0s, >0.8s dá 500) | Função `run_heavy_fraud_check` no topo da **Top Table / Flamegraph** | `curl -X POST \"http://localhost:8080/checkout?scenario=cpu\"` |"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "1A. Volume de Tráfego (Cenário: $scenario)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 2,
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_total{route=\"/payment\",scenario=~\"$scenario\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "req/s"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "1B. Taxa de Erros HTTP 5xx (Cenário: $scenario)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 5 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 15 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 35 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(http_server_requests_total{route=\"/payment\",scenario=~\"$scenario\",status_code=~\"5..\"}[5m])) or vector(0)) / clamp_min(sum(rate(http_server_requests_total{route=\"/payment\",scenario=~\"$scenario\"}[5m])), 1e-9)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "1C. Latência P95 (Cenário: $scenario)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 5 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 0.8 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1.5 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{route=\"/payment\",scenario=~\"$scenario\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P95"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "1D. Erros 502 no Checkout — Cascata (Cenário: $scenario)",
      "description": "Mostra quantas falhas do serviço payment refletiram como erro 502 Bad Gateway para o cliente no checkout.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 5 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 10 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 25 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(http_server_requests_total{route=\"/checkout\",scenario=~\"$scenario\",status_code=\"502\"}[5m])) or vector(0)) / clamp_min(sum(rate(http_server_requests_total{route=\"/checkout\",scenario=~\"$scenario\"}[5m])), 1e-9)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "2A. Quem é o vilão da lentidão? (Latência P95 por Cenário — Clique para Filtrar)",
      "description": "Clique na barra de qualquer cenário para filtrar todo o dashboard por ele!",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 9 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 3.2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.4 },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 0.8 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1.5 }
            ]
          },
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Filtrar Dashboard pelo cenário: ${__field.labels.scenario}",
              "url": "/d/incident-resolution?var-scenario=${__field.labels.scenario}&${__url_time_range}"
            },
            {
              "title": "Limpar Filtro (Mostrar Todos)",
              "url": "/d/incident-resolution?var-scenario=$__all&${__url_time_range}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "valueMode": "color",
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, scenario) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{route=\"/payment\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{scenario}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "2B. Volume de Requisições por Cenário (Clique na barra para filtrar)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 9 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "stacking": { "mode": "normal" },
            "fillOpacity": 85
          },
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Filtrar Dashboard por ${__field.labels.scenario}",
              "url": "/d/incident-resolution?var-scenario=${__field.labels.scenario}&${__url_time_range}"
            },
            {
              "title": "Mostrar Todos os Cenários",
              "url": "/d/incident-resolution?var-scenario=$__all&${__url_time_range}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "fast" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "green", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "io" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "yellow", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "db" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "red", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "cpu" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "purple", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (scenario) (rate(http_server_requests_total{route=\"/payment\",scenario=~\"$scenario\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{scenario}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "2C. Latência P95 + Exemplars Clicáveis (Métrica ➔ Trace)",
      "description": "Passe o mouse sobre os losangos (Exemplars) e clique para abrir o Trace no Tempo.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 9 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "showPoints": "always"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_latency_bucket{service=\"payment\",span_kind=\"SPAN_KIND_SERVER\",payment_scenario=~\"$scenario\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P95 via Tempo SpanMetrics — $scenario (Losangos = Exemplars ★)",
          "exemplar": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{route=\"/payment\",scenario=~\"$scenario\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P95 via Aplicação — $scenario",
          "exemplar": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "nodeGraph",
      "title": "3A. Topologia da Arquitetura (Service Graph via Tempo)",
      "description": "Mapa gerado automaticamente a partir dos Traces distribuídos entre checkout e payment.",
      "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 10, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
          "queryType": "serviceMap"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "3B. Tabela de Traces Recentes no Tempo (Clique no Trace ID para abrir a Cascata)",
      "description": "Lista de requisições filtradas pelo cenário selecionado ($scenario). Clique no Trace ID azul para inspecionar os spans!",
      "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 14, "x": 10, "y": 16 },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "footer": { "show": false }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ resource.service.name = \"payment\" && span.payment.scenario =~ \"${scenario:pipe}\" }",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "4A. Logs de Alerta e Erro no Loki (Cenário: $scenario)",
      "description": "Exibe WARNING e ERROR do cenário selecionado. Expanda uma linha e use o link TraceID para abrir o trace no Tempo.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 11, "w": 11, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{service_name=~\"payment|checkout\"} | scenario=~\"${scenario:pipe}\" |~ \"Payment gateway high latency detected|Database connection timeout - pool exhausted|Fraud check exceeded CPU budget|Payment failed\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "flamegraph",
      "title": "4B. Continuous Profiling — Top Table + Flamegraph (Cenário: $scenario)",
      "description": "CPU gasta pelo payment no cenário selecionado. Em cpu, run_heavy_fraud_check domina; em io/db quase não há amostras, porque esperar não consome CPU.",
      "datasource": { "type": "grafana-pyroscope-datasource", "uid": "pyroscope" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 11, "w": 13, "x": 11, "y": 24 },
      "options": {
        "displayMode": "both"
      },
      "links": [
        {
          "title": "Abrir Pyroscope no Explore",
          "url": "/explore?schemaVersion=1&orgId=1&panes=%7B%22pyro%22%3A%7B%22datasource%22%3A%22pyroscope%22%2C%22queries%22%3A%5B%7B%22refId%22%3A%22A%22%2C%22datasource%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22grafana-pyroscope-datasource%22%2C%22uid%22%3A%22pyroscope%22%7D%2C%22queryType%22%3A%22profile%22%2C%22profileTypeId%22%3A%22process_cpu%3Acpu%3Ananoseconds%3Acpu%3Ananoseconds%22%2C%22labelSelector%22%3A%22%7Bservice_name%3D%5C%22payment%5C%22%7D%22%7D%5D%7D%7D",
          "targetBlank": true
        }
      ],
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "grafana-pyroscope-datasource", "uid": "pyroscope" },
          "queryType": "profile",
          "profileTypeId": "process_cpu:cpu:nanoseconds:cpu:nanoseconds",
          "labelSelector": "{service_name=\"payment\", scenario=~\"${scenario:pipe}\"}"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}